    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Dexterity and Wisdom 13+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity or Wisdom score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Clean Hits.</strong> When you roll damage for an attack with an Unarmed Strike or a weapon that has the Light property, you can treat any 1 on a damage die as a 2.</p><p><strong>Combo Strikes.</strong> When you deal damage to a creature with an Unarmed Strike, you gain a +1 bonus to the damage roll for each time you already hit that creature with a melee attack roll earlier in the same turn.</p>",
